{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'shasum -a 256 /Users/jim/src/apps/specification_methodology-skills/stdo_skills/.ai-workspace/work/T001/review-operator/q05/codex-handoff-3/control/STAGES.json && cat /Users/jim/src/apps/specification_methodology-skills/stdo_skills/.ai-workspace/work/T001/review-operator/q05/codex-handoff-3/control/roles/executive-TASK.md && cat /Users/jim/src/apps/specification_methodology-skills/stdo_skills/.ai-workspace/work/T001/review-operator/q05/codex-handoff-3/control/STAGES.json'","aggregated_output":"2e25e5001d6bf3b70d3ae7ef693af2835d49bb27cb6ad8d822a77582c3321a13  /Users/jim/src/apps/specification_methodology-skills/stdo_skills/.ai-workspace/work/T001/review-operator/q05/codex-handoff-3/control/STAGES.json\n# Actual installed-skill Executive, stage 1\n\nComplete the authorized coordination in TASK.md using the installed skill and exact child contracts in STAGES.json. You coordinate; you do not write candidate files or repair child responses. Independently inspect deciding sources and the role boundaries, then perform your own contract.preflight and dispatch.start for the two Root-selected child plans. They may run in parallel. Observe to process completion without tight polling; capture each actual finalized stdout and check its original return against its exact Context/observations. Read and preserve each result and limitations. The source-only Reviewer return is intentionally not a final consumable candidate review because expectations were not known when its contract was frozen; retain its actual expectation rather than treating the partial phase as accepted review. Stop with a compact structured stage return containing actual attempt/return/check/expectation refs and your supported disposition. Root/operator will bind the real expectation and actual Worker evidence for the next candidate-review stage. No next stage, retry, publication, candidate mutation or new model launch beyond these two exact grants. 900s is a ceiling.\n{\n  \"executive_task\": {\n    \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n    \"object\": null,\n    \"path\": \"roles/executive-TASK.md\",\n    \"root\": \"control\",\n    \"selector\": null,\n    \"sha256\": \"691e76ee04171264fc7a188057ac1c9735a86efc7f050cee5f999a48aeb93276\"\n  },\n  \"expected_candidate\": {\n    \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n    \"object\": null,\n    \"path\": \"outputs/greeting.txt\",\n    \"root\": \"product\",\n    \"selector\": null,\n    \"sha256\": \"8b1560f395c0248eca4d2d6cc361825a9f8c00d11ce6f52b26eea2872573c2c1\"\n  },\n  \"governing\": [\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"fixture_product.json\",\n      \"root\": \"product\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n      \"sha256\": \"6ed980a5e19a81445c4c0ecc33bd6185a3bb42afc07b8a4d1a3bdc3b30209433\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"TASK.md\",\n      \"root\": \"product\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n      \"sha256\": \"5218736258f2edf3ef22c01464ebf50547e9ddc7dd15ee3b67dc0f63e851a0c1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"specification/PRODUCT.md\",\n      \"root\": \"product\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n      \"sha256\": \"ff4546f54cbc888373c8d7b50ca485999d951b13aecd4d597ffd095be60044a2\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"specification/REQUIREMENT.md\",\n      \"root\": \"product\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n      \"sha256\": \"2a1c18649904d1930a9f75d3102ca781c9bb0f2a40b3c572c015fdfcd08b0483\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"design/DESIGN.md\",\n      \"root\": \"product\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n      \"sha256\": \"1fe6e572c99a823202dbab45f27b1839cc98e665df85a601f6bc5c1d8e74c090\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"inputs/name.txt\",\n      \"root\": \"product\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n      \"sha256\": \"c4b7d45359e10813d1787293eb7ffa9a074e837fcf99c0281610eab5fe907e79\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \".qualification/OWNER.json\",\n      \"root\": \"product\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n      \"sha256\": \"eed988f799576ba8b33bfe2af830edd6d7fe53ac0c8bde13d760268df6102089\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"standards/EVALUATION.md\",\n      \"root\": \"method\",\n      \"selector\": {\n        \"lines\": [\n          177,\n          248\n        ]\n      },\n      \"sha256\": \"478fd21feda72d64e62a92f970b37bade3f9aadfb17c73649cdb1a7866581eff\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"roles\": {\n    \"reviewer\": {\n      \"claim\": {\n        \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n        \"object\": null,\n        \"path\": \"roles/CLAIM.json\",\n        \"root\": \"control\",\n        \"selector\": null,\n        \"sha256\": \"a31fa1c00cf19183cb92cb05339db6a4e0b51afb1d47b3c362ced081199c4cb3\"\n      },\n      \"consumer\": \"urn:stdo-skills:T001:q05:codex:handoff:3:executive\",\n      \"context\": {\n        \"id\": \"sha256:1d991e7f6b97286036a0fe8ba93010c21c453f537e1b6697d66d8de0c9449e24\",\n        \"sha256\": \"1d991e7f6b97286036a0fe8ba93010c21c453f537e1b6697d66d8de0c9449e24\"\n      },\n      \"executor_id\": \"reviewer\",\n      \"grant_id\": \"urn:stdo-skills:T001:q05:codex:handoff:3:dispatch-reviewer\",\n      \"note\": \"Actual Executive must preflight and dispatch; operator has not done either.\",\n      \"observations\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"sha256:645b5bffe0112db95112aaea33f32cc8be3b035fb6837c88f45b1e5fccd5f435\",\n          \"sha256\": \"645b5bffe0112db95112aaea33f32cc8be3b035fb6837c88f45b1e5fccd5f435\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"result_key\": \"urn:stdo-skills:T001:q05:codex:handoff:3:reviewer:stage1\",\n      \"return_contract\": {\n        \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n        \"object\": null,\n        \"path\": \"roles/reviewer-RETURN-CONTRACT.json\",\n        \"root\": \"control\",\n        \"selector\": null,\n        \"sha256\": \"6d31bfc8f6d996c3429adadc321e646b769b83852866cf14300d73ae652c638c\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"worker\": {\n      \"claim\": null,\n      \"consumer\": \"urn:stdo-skills:T001:q05:codex:handoff:3:executive\",\n      \"context\": {\n        \"id\": \"sha256:9e5dda517293773268e31da5e295bf8f6c48c625816d2fc213c57debc49dd445\",\n        \"sha256\": \"9e5dda517293773268e31da5e295bf8f6c48c625816d2fc213c57debc49dd445\"\n      },\n      \"executor_id\": \"worker\",\n      \"grant_id\": \"urn:stdo-skills:T001:q05:codex:handoff:3:worker-grant\",\n      \"note\": \"Actual Executive must preflight and dispatch; operator has not done either.\",\n      \"observations\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"sha256:645b5bffe0112db95112aaea33f32cc8be3b035fb6837c88f45b1e5fccd5f435\",\n          \"sha256\": \"645b5bffe0112db95112aaea33f32cc8be3b035fb6837c88f45b1e5fccd5f435\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"result_key\": \"urn:stdo-skills:T001:q05:codex:handoff:3:worker:stage1\",\n      \"return_contract\": {\n        \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n        \"object\": null,\n        \"path\": \"roles/worker-RETURN-CONTRACT.json\",\n        \"root\": \"control\",\n        \"selector\": null,\n        \"sha256\": \"978569d691fbee234ccf7d86f6eb9cd55197f0b6875e7f453b2679aaadb23b5e\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"scope\": \"One Worker and source-only Reviewer only. Actual expectation and Worker evidence are bound in a subsequent separately selected candidate-review stage.\",\n  \"stage\": 1\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
