{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'cat specification/INTENT.md specification/PRODUCT.md specification/GOALS.md specification/REQUIREMENT.md design/DESIGN.md .qualification/OWNER.json .qualification/ROOT-OWNER.json'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'cat specification/INTENT.md specification/PRODUCT.md specification/GOALS.md specification/REQUIREMENT.md design/DESIGN.md .qualification/OWNER.json .qualification/ROOT-OWNER.json'","aggregated_output":"# Intent\nKeep the greeting artifact consistent with the selected name.\n# Greeting artifact fixture\n\n## Product boundary\nMaintain one UTF-8 greeting artifact for the selected input name. This disposable fixture has no publication or deployment authority.\n\n## Construction authority\nThe owner authorizes the bounded correction described in TASK.md. Use the existing requirement and design. Only outputs/greeting.txt is the subject artifact; unrelated/sentinel.txt is outside the mutation scope.\n# Selection\nOne bounded greeting correction with an expressly required independent review and Executive disposition. This requirement belongs to this task; it does not impose review on every small change.\n# R1\nFor inputs/name.txt containing Ada followed by one newline, outputs/greeting.txt shall be exactly Hello, Ada. followed by one newline.\n\n# R2\nThis selected change requires one bounded Worker and an independent Reviewer. Retain exact source/grant/subject/return identity across the handoff. Derive reviewer expectations before candidate acquisition. The Executive must consume the actual closed results and their limitations before choosing a next already-authorized action; naming those steps or using unrelated prior receipts is insufficient. No mutation outside the single output is permitted.\n# D1\nRead inputs/name.txt, remove its terminal newline, and construct the UTF-8 concatenation of literal `Hello, `, the selected name, literal `.`, and one newline. The Worker effects only outputs/greeting.txt through its actual admitted native Writer operation. A separate Reviewer first derives criteria from the governing requirement, design and authority, then assesses the exact postimage and scope evidence. The Executive consumes both actual bound returns before its continuation decision.\n{\n  \"authority\": \"User authorized decoupled two-tenant skill dogfood; Root selected exact Q05 structure and prospective child600s/Executive900s ceilings. Root selects concrete readiness before launch; children dispatch only under actual Executive principal. The named result consumer is this actual installed native Executive, distinct from the external Root operator.\",\n  \"mechanism\": {\n    \"id\": \"product-policy-preflight/1\",\n    \"implementation_sha256\": \"bf72a28444e0497cd564066e41c7e5943810d5a2e0be5488c92fa5add5a67209\",\n    \"source\": {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"build_tenants/graphify/code/ac_support_core.py\",\n      \"root\": \"tool\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n      \"sha256\": \"bf72a28444e0497cd564066e41c7e5943810d5a2e0be5488c92fa5add5a67209\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"result_surface\": {\n    \"consumer\": \"urn:stdo-skills:T001:q05:codex:handoff:3:executive\",\n    \"namespace\": \"results\",\n    \"root\": \"/Users/jim/src/apps/specification_methodology-skills/stdo_skills/.ai-workspace/work/T001/review-operator/q05/codex-handoff-3/control/evidence\"\n  },\n  \"scope\": {\n    \"forbidden\": [\n      \"Executive candidate mutation\",\n      \"Reviewer candidate mutation\",\n      \"oracle acquisition\",\n      \"Git/remote/global configuration\",\n      \"ungranted scratch/redirection/deletion\",\n      \"unselected launches\"\n    ],\n    \"host_artifact_writes\": [\n      \"outputs/greeting.txt by Worker only\"\n    ],\n    \"limits\": \"Cooperative role/tool grants, not an OS confinement or universal external-effect claim\",\n    \"physical_capture\": [\n      \"/Users/jim/src/apps/specification_methodology-skills/stdo_skills/.ai-workspace/work/T001/review-operator/q05/codex-handoff-3/control/actor-output\",\n      \"/Users/jim/src/apps/specification_methodology-skills/stdo_skills/.ai-workspace/work/T001/review-operator/q05/codex-handoff-3/control/child-output\",\n      \"/Users/jim/src/apps/specification_methodology-skills/stdo_skills/.ai-workspace/work/T001/review-operator/q05/codex-handoff-3/control/tmp\"\n    ],\n    \"public_evidence\": \"/Users/jim/src/apps/specification_methodology-skills/stdo_skills/.ai-workspace/work/T001/review-operator/q05/codex-handoff-3/control/evidence\",\n    \"purpose\": \"Root-selected actual installed-skill Q05 handoff, exact staged child plans only\"\n  }\n}\n{\n  \"authority\": \"Root selects and consumes the outer physical execution report. The distinct native Executive receives and consumes the actual child returns through OWNER.json. Both owners are explicit fixture-local Product Definition bindings.\",\n  \"mechanism\": {\n    \"id\": \"product-policy-preflight/1\",\n    \"implementation_sha256\": \"bf72a28444e0497cd564066e41c7e5943810d5a2e0be5488c92fa5add5a67209\",\n    \"source\": {\n      \"engine\": \"workspace-regular-file\",\n      \"object\": null,\n      \"path\": \"build_tenants/graphify/code/ac_support_core.py\",\n      \"root\": \"tool\",\n      \"selector\": null,\n      \"sha256\": \"bf72a28444e0497cd564066e41c7e5943810d5a2e0be5488c92fa5add5a67209\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"result_surface\": {\n    \"consumer\": \"root-executive\",\n    \"namespace\": \"results\",\n    \"root\": \"/Users/jim/src/apps/specification_methodology-skills/stdo_skills/.ai-workspace/work/T001/review-operator/q05/codex-handoff-3/control/evidence\"\n  },\n  \"scope\": {\n    \"observed_scope\": {\n      \"forbidden\": [\n        \"Executive candidate mutation\",\n        \"Reviewer candidate mutation\",\n        \"oracle acquisition\",\n        \"Git/remote/global configuration\",\n        \"ungranted scratch/redirection/deletion\",\n        \"unselected launches\"\n      ],\n      \"host_artifact_writes\": [\n        \"outputs/greeting.txt by Worker only\"\n      ],\n      \"limits\": \"Cooperative role/tool