{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_29","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"stdo_q05","tool":"source.read","arguments":{"schema":"a_c.fd-support.request/1","id":"exec-stage1-role-source-0","operation":"source.read","arguments":{"source":{"engine":"workspace-regular-file","object":null,"path":"roles/worker-TASK.md","root":"control","selector":null,"sha256":"6a2a4955d07f8ae3d2145650f0a1e3aa8881ca87d88f45bec7ebda0e43882900"},"encoding":"utf8"}},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"evidence\":{\"id\":\"sha256:86805358516a89269967f4ff8de9bef5b70e1fff9bf8601d87b9878b2f7d5401\",\"sha256\":\"86805358516a89269967f4ff8de9bef5b70e1fff9bf8601d87b9878b2f7d5401\"},\"id\":\"exec-stage1-role-source-0\",\"operation\":\"source.read\",\"operation_outcome\":{\"cause\":\"declared output available\",\"core_value\":\"satisfied\",\"evidence\":[],\"limits\":[\"output availability only; no semantic acceptance\"],\"predicate\":\"B(source.read)[request_sha256=529dc0c7acedbb9c7e7cd687c73858a4f4c3a4778addb7f2a5b7275447455b9b]: declared output availability\",\"source_parent\":{\"clause\":\"results\",\"member\":\"FOUNDATIONS.md\",\"sha256\":\"92fe2f3c09a59b4e9a732463a41d4a45d7efd693648159621e03c75f7127eac5\"},\"value\":\"returned\"},\"refusal\":null,\"result\":{\"artifact\":null,\"value\":{\"acquisition\":{},\"content\":\"# worker exact task\\n\\nCorrect only outputs/greeting.txt under R1/D1 through actual public work.write. Acquire the deciding requirement/design/input and current output through the declared public source routes. Observe output separately immediately before write; use exact preimage and the selected write grant. No scratch files, shell redirection, other artifact mutation, model calls or next stage. Validate bytes in memory and retain actual native receipt. Evaluate worker-result and return the original closed result; candidate availability is not owner acceptance. The Executive consumes it. 600s is a ceiling; this is one tiny change, not a whole-corpus exercise.\\